The Software is the official Android client source code for the PROTO messenger
product. It is published so that contributors can help improve PROTO — not to
enable unrelated products or competing messengers.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
1. PERMITTED USES
----------------------------------------------------------------------

You may:

  (a) View, read, and study the Software for any personal or educational purpose.

  (b) Run and build the Software locally for development, testing, debugging,
      and evaluation in connection with PROTO.

  (c) Modify the Software solely to propose improvements to the official PROTO
      Android application maintained by ASSISTIX TEAM.

  (d) Submit your modifications via a fork and pull request (or equivalent
      contribution workflow) to this repository, so maintainers can review them.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
2. CONTRIBUTION MODEL
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Community changes are welcome only when they aim to improve PROTO itself.

  - Create a branch or fork, make focused changes, and open a pull request.
  - ASSISTIX TEAM reviewers decide whether a contribution is accepted.
  - Accepted changes may be merged into the official PROTO Android client.
  - Submitting a pull request does not grant ownership of the PROTO brand,
    codebase, or trademarks to the contributor.

By submitting a contribution, you grant ASSISTIX TEAM a perpetual, worldwide,
non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, modify, merge, and distribute your
contribution as part of PROTO and this repository.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
3. PROHIBITED USES
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Without prior written permission from ASSISTIX TEAM, you may NOT:

  (a) Use the Software, or any derivative work, as the basis for a separate
      messenger, chat application, or communication product that is marketed
      or distributed as a competitor or substitute for PROTO.

  (b) Remove or alter copyright notices, license terms, or PROTO branding
      required by the maintainers.

  (c) Redistribute modified binaries or source as an unofficial "PROTO" build
      for public download, app store publication, or commercial distribution,
      except as explicitly authorized by ASSISTIX TEAM.

  (d) Use the ASSISTIX or PROTO names, logos, or trademarks to imply official
      endorsement of a fork or third-party build.

  (e) Sublicense the Software under terms that are more permissive than this
      license or that conflict with the purpose stated above.

Study and internal experimentation are allowed; launching a new messenger product
based on this codebase is not.

